    "summary": "Spend 1 CP in any phase when an **ORKS AIRCRAFT** unit of yours is **destroyed**, before anyone rolls for **[Deadly Demise](vsdata:core-ability/deadly-demise)**. Then, for that **ORKS** unit:\n\n1. It loses the **[Deadly Demise](vsdata:core-ability/deadly-demise)** ability.\n2. Pick an enemy unit no more than 12\" from it and roll 8 D6. Each 4+ inflicts 1 **[mortal wound](vsdata:core-rule/mortal-wounds)** on that enemy unit.\n3. Take your unit off the battlefield.",
